  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6900 PROXIMATE AUDIENCE PYROTECHNICS, FLAME EFFECTS, AND SPECIAL EFFECTS RULES",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Saf-C 6900 PROXIMATE AUDIENCE PYROTECHNICS, FLAME EFFECTS, AND SPECIAL EFFECTS RULES\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #10067, effective 12-28-11, adopted Chapter Saf-C 6900 on proximate audience pyrotechnics and flame effects rules. Chapter Saf-C 6900 replaces the former Part Saf-C 6018 on pyrotechnics and Part Saf-C 6019 on licensing of pyrotechnicians, which had been in Chapter Saf-C 6000 on the State Fire Code. The former Saf-C 6018 and Saf-C 6019 had been repealed by Document #10058, effective 12-23-11, which contained Saf-C 6000. Document #10067 replaces all prior filings affecting the former Saf-C 6018 and Saf-C 6019, which included the following documents:",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6900.html"
}
